PMWorkspace installed.

Start here after restarting Codex:

  Use $pm-workspace to show the welcome guide and help me choose a workflow.

Useful first prompts:

  Use $pm-workspace to clarify this product idea: <one sentence>
  使用 $pm-workspace 帮我梳理一个新产品想法：<一句话想法>
  使用 $pm-workspace 帮我对这个功能做 3 个移动端原型方向，每个方案单独出图：<功能描述>

PMWorkspace flow:
  pm-jobs -> pm-strategy-review -> pm-brief -> pm-prototype-shotgun -> pm-handoff
EOF
